[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the positive (1a) and negative (1b) battery terminals and place them at the side.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the battery retaining bracket (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002971.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the battery from the drip tray.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the battery in the drip tray.</p><p>Fit the retaining bracket and tighten the bolts.</p><p>Connect the positive and negative terminals.</p>"],[8,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Make sure that the ignition key is in the OFF position.</p><p>1. Undo the nuts and disconnect the battery negative terminal (1a) and positive terminal (1b) and move it aside.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004236\">See A1H BATTERY ( ENGINE )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004221\">See A1A BATTERY ( ENGINE )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the battery retaining bracket (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002972.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the battery in its housing.</p><p>Fit the retaining bracket and tighten the bolts.</p><p>Connect the positive terminal to the battery.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004221\">See A1A BATTERY ( ENGINE )</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004236\">See A1H BATTERY ( ENGINE )</a></p></td></tr></table></div>"]]